        "content": "## B2B Booking Alert\nSkips OA/internal team alerts. Only notifies the participant by dispatching:\n- welcome-whatsapp\n- welcome-email\n\nExpects: {\n  notification_id, engagement_id,\n  participant_details: { participant_user_id, ... },\n  members?: []  // ignored — not notified\n}",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 2200
